  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "那……那个……\n请你帮帮我……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A34E2A20262026000A8BF74F605E2E5E2E62112026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我接下来要和一位\n喜欢扒手猫的女孩约会……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621163A54E0B67658981548C4E004F4D000A559C6B226252624B732B768459735B697EA64F1A2026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF55B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但我太紧张了，感觉没办法好好说话。\n所以想请你帮我！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F466211592A7D275F204E86FF0C611F89C96CA1529E6CD5597D597D8BF48BDD3002000A62404EE560F38BF74F605E2E6211FF0100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请你协助我和她对话！\n拜托了！真的拜托了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF74F60534F52A96211548C59795BF98BDDFF01000A62DC62584E86FF01771F768462DC62584E86FF0100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是准备好了，就跟我说一声吧。\n真的拜托你了……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F51C65907597D4E86FF0C5C318DDF62118BF44E0058F054273002000A771F768462DC62584F604E8620262026FF0100100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF55B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你准备好协助我了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6051C65907597D534F52A962114E865417FF1F00100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "包在我身上！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5305572862118EAB4E0AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF77B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要协助就赶紧协助。\n我紧张得心脏都快爆炸了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981534F52A95C318D767D27534F52A93002000A62117D275F205F975FC3810F90FD5FEB720670B84E862026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜……拜托你了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC2026202662DC62584F604E86300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她真的很喜欢扒手猫……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n为此我也捉了扒手猫过来，\n但因为才刚捉到，我对它还不太熟悉……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5979771F76845F88559C6B226252624B732B2026202600100001BE01000A4E3A6B6462114E5F63494E866252624B732B8FC76765FF0C000A4F4656E04E3A624D521A63495230FF0C62115BF95B838FD84E0D592A719F60892026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……嗯喵。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202655EF55B530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以请你坐在我附近，\n有什么事就协助我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE58BF74F6057505728621196448FD1FF0C000A67094EC04E484E8B5C31534F52A962115427300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她马上就要来了……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我不知道该答什么的时候，\n就拜托你教我怎么回答比较好了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59799A6C4E0A5C31898167654E862026202600100001BE01000A62114E0D77E590538BE57B544EC04E48768465F65019FF0C000A5C3162DC62584F6065596211600E4E4856DE7B546BD48F83597D4E862026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好棒的咖啡馆和扒手猫。\n要是还能聊得很愉快就再好不过了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D68D27684549655619986548C6252624B732B3002000A8981662F8FD880FD804A5F975F8861095FEB5C31518D597D4E0D8FC74E86300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你应该知道扒手猫\n是什么宝可梦吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E948BE577E590536252624B732B000A662F4EC04E485B9D53EF68A65427FF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "坏心眼宝可梦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "574F5FC3773C5B9D53EF68A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "冷酷宝可梦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51B791775B9D53EF68A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "威吓宝可梦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A0154135B9D53EF68A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！坏心眼这个词\n完全就是在形容扒手猫啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF01574F5FC3773C8FD94E2A8BCD000A5B8C51685C31662F57285F625BB96252624B732B554AFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃……是这样吗？\n感觉不太像扒手猫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "544320262026662F8FD968375417FF1F000A611F89C94E0D592A50CF6252624B732B300200100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你应该也知道扒手猫\n为什么会偷人类的东西吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E948BE54E5F77E590536252624B732B000A4E3A4EC04E484F1A50774EBA7C7B76844E1C897F5427FF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了生存",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86751F5B580000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了好玩",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86597D73A90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为讨厌训练家",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A8BA8538C8BAD7EC35BB60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！和扒手猫在一起，\n每天都能享受紧张和刺激！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF01548C6252624B732B57284E008D77FF0C000A6BCF592990FD80FD4EAB53D77D275F20548C523A6FC0FF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃……是这样吗？\n扒手猫不是很随性的吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "544320262026662F8FD968375417FF1F000A6252624B732B4E0D662F5F88968F602776845417FF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你一定连扒手猫\n学不会什么招式都知道吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E005B9A8FDE6252624B732B000A5B664E0D4F1A4EC04E4862DB5F0F90FD77E590535427FF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无理取闹",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E0740653D695F90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "诡计",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BE18BA10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "移花接木",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "79FB82B163A567280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "太对了！\n看似能学会但其实学不会，这才迷人啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "592A5BF94E86FF01000A770B4F3C80FD5B664F1A4F4651765B9E5B664E0D4F1AFF0C8FD9624D8FF74EBA554AFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呃……是这样吗？\n扒手猫会用那个招式的吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "544320262026662F8FD968375417FF1F000A6252624B732B4F1A752890A34E2A62DB5F0F76845427FF1F00100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯喵～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55B5FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和喜欢扒手猫的人\n能聊的话题就是多啊！真开心～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C559C6B226252624B732B76844EBA000A80FD804A76848BDD98985C31662F591A554AFF01771F5F005FC3FF5EFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那……那个……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n露夏……扒手猫似乎\n也很喜欢你……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A32026202690A34E2A2026202600100001BE01000A9732590F202620266252624B732B4F3C4E4E000A4E5F5F88559C6B224F602026202600100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯喵～",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55B5FF5E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也非常非常……开心。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果可以的话，\n希望能……再和你见面。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F975E5E38975E5E38202620265F005FC3300200100001BE01000A5982679C53EF4EE576848BDDFF0C000A5E0C671B80FD20262026518D548C4F6089C19762300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这个嘛……你对扒手猫好像一知半解的样子，\n跟你聊它感觉不够嗨啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我先告辞咯～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A561B202620264F605BF96252624B732B597D50CF4E0077E5534A89E3768468375B50FF0C000A8DDF4F60804A5B83611F89C94E0D591F55E8554A300200100001BE00000A62115148544A8F9E54AFFF5EFF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "委托人的眼前……\n变得一片漆黑！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59D462584EBA7684773C524D20262026000A53D85F974E0072476F069ED1FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊是啊～！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我也还想和你多聊聊\n关于扒手猫的话题！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǣ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554A662F554AFF5EFF0100100001BE01000A62114E5F8FD860F3548C4F60591A804A804A000A51734E8E6252624B732B76848BDD9898FF0100100002011401E30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯喵～♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF55B5FF5E266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "非……非常感谢！\n那个……我去去就回。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "975E20262026975E5E38611F8C22FF01000A90A34E2A20262026621153BB53BB5C3156DE300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你协助我……\n这些题目对我来说太难了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60534F52A9621120262026000A8FD94E9B989876EE5BF9621167658BF4592A96BE4E86300200100002011401E20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了你，我以后还能和她见上面！\n请允许我由衷地感谢你……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǢ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2336,
